jobs_results.description:
We are recruiting a Big Data Architect (m/f) to strengthen our team in Madrid, with the possibility of working in a hybrid mode.

What we are looking for:
• Minimum of 5 years of experience en Big Data implementation projects;
• Proven experience in design of Big Data and Data analytics solutions according to customer requirements;
• Excellent communication skills, in conversations at CxO level, ability to adapt the message to the customer feedback, etc;
• Experience in definition of Big Data architecture with different tools and environments: Cloud (AWS, Azure and GCP), Cloudera, No-sql data bases (Cassandra, Mongo DB), Databricks, ELK, Kafka, Snowflake, amongst others;
• Experience in Data Engineering and data quality tools (Informatica, Talend, etc.) (valued);
• Experience in Data Governance and Data Catalog solutions : IBM, Axon, Informatica EDC, Colibra, Purview, etc (valued).

What we have to offer:
• Flexibility in the work regime (remote);
• Opportunity for professional growth... in a growing company;
• Collaborative and supportive work environment;
• Competitive benefits package.

If you identify with this profile, send us your updated CV to recrutamento@movilges.com

If you want to learn more about us:

Movilges IT Consulting has over 30 years of experience in the Spanish market, specializing in Logistics, Mobility, and IT. We offer consulting services, application development, and system maintenance. Just as the technological universe is constantly evolving, Movilges IT Consulting aims to evolve as well, increasing its presence in Portugal. We strive not only to provide the best services to partners and clients but also to offer the best conditions, benefits, and professional growth opportunities for our entire team.

In Portugal, we are present in different sectors such as technology, health, public administration, energy, services, banking, and insurance.

By submitting your application, you authorize Movilges IT Consulting to process your personal data, such as name, email, phone number, and information about your academic and professional experiences as stated in your CV. The processing of this data serves only the legitimate purposes of the company, i.e., for the recruitment processes of qualified professionals for our team. For any questions related to your personal data, you can contact us at portugal@movilges.com

